    "title": "Maher Named JK's Long-Haul Driver of the Year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago Dulles-based JK Moving Services has named Eddie Maher of Wilmington, NC, as its Long-Distance Driver of the Year. Maher received the award, which come with a $5,000 bonus, based on his work ethic, commitment to outstanding customer experience and a focus on safety, while embracing JK’s core values and brand promise of care and respect, the company said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
